First off all I learned a lot of new French words really quickly, but the only thing was sometimes when I did a special event thing I went on it and saw it said use 15 power to do a language game, but when I tapped it I didn’t do any words and wanted to see how much power I had left, but it already took all of my power without me even doing anything and it didn’t let me play the card game anymore.


Also it didn’t even let me change my name whatsoever the whole time and my name was just my last name and would lat me change it…

